WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
From your idea to your door. Two ways to order: choose a catalogue design or request something completely custom.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Choose your favourite. Open the Catalogue. Check the product size, lighting and offer price. Select “Personalise & enquire”.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Add your details. Enter your text and quantity. Choose standard or custom size. Select “Prepare my enquiry”, then “Continue on WhatsApp”.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Have your own idea? Open the custom-project form. Choose a category, material and lighting. Describe your idea and preferred size.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Share it. Make it yours. Send your brief on WhatsApp. Attach reference images separately. We finalise the artwork, price and delivery details with you.

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
10% now. 90% on delivery. Pay the 10% advance only after the design is finalised. We share payment details on WhatsApp and confirm your order.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Delivered in 3–5 working days. From order confirmation. Receive your personalised piece and pay the remaining 90% on delivery.
